WEBVTT

00:00.390 --> 00:01.700
I'm Mitama.

00:01.700 --> 00:03.290
Your God!

00:06.760 --> 00:07.770
Huh?

00:13.200 --> 00:15.360
What just happened?

00:15.360 --> 00:16.650
Huh? This is...

00:17.700 --> 00:18.610
Oneechan!

00:18.610 --> 00:19.410
Al!

00:19.410 --> 00:22.410
I wasn't really planning on 
reviving anyone but Yukito.

00:22.410 --> 00:25.500
Guess I'm just overflowing with power.

00:26.080 --> 00:28.250
<i>She brought the dead back to life?</i>

00:28.250 --> 00:31.010
<i>Is she really... a god?</i>

00:34.420 --> 00:36.180
<i>What is up with them?</i>

00:36.180 --> 00:39.970
<i>They just left, as if 
nothing had even happened.</i>

00:39.970 --> 00:41.560
What?!

00:41.890 --> 00:42.860
Yo!

00:46.020 --> 00:49.150
You're alive!

00:52.020 --> 00:53.260
Really?

00:54.120 --> 00:55.370
But the end of life...

00:56.200 --> 00:59.330
We thought we were goners.

00:59.640 --> 01:01.950
But it looks like we're still alive!

01:03.160 --> 01:06.290
This calls for a celebratory drink!

01:23.770 --> 01:31.070
KamiKatsu: Working for
God in a Godless World

02:37.010 --> 02:42.010
Episode 2:
We know we are not worthy

O great Lord Mitama

Beautiful is—

02:37.420 --> 02:38.710
"We know we are not worthy

02:38.710 --> 02:40.520
O great Lord Mitama

02:40.520 --> 02:42.010
Beautiful is—"

02:42.010 --> 02:43.300
Cheers!

02:43.710 --> 02:46.390
Cheers!

02:51.820 --> 02:53.810
<i>We somehow lived through that...</i>

02:54.480 --> 02:57.530
<i>But now I've pissed off 
that huge Imperial capital!</i>

02:58.110 --> 02:59.350
<i>What should I do?</i>

02:59.350 --> 03:02.080
<i>How do I protect this village?</i>

03:02.080 --> 03:04.430
<i>We're a shoddy village 
far away from everything.</i>

03:04.430 --> 03:07.670
<i>We don't stand a chance, neither from 
a military nor an economic standpoint.</i>

03:07.670 --> 03:10.750
<i>If there's one thing that we 
could maybe count on, it's...</i>

03:11.620 --> 03:14.370
What'cha lookin' all depressed for?

03:19.150 --> 03:20.420
Let me go!

03:20.420 --> 03:23.430
I want to get to Yukito as soon as possible!

03:22.180 --> 03:24.390
Put some clothes on first!

03:23.510 --> 03:24.390
<b>Mitama is running away from Alural</b>

03:26.590 --> 03:28.020
What are you doing?

03:33.060 --> 03:34.150
<b>Alural caught Mitama!</b>

03:37.900 --> 03:39.280
First things first!

03:39.280 --> 03:42.450
What is your relationship 
with Yukito-san, anyway?

03:43.270 --> 03:44.460
Since...

03:45.390 --> 03:47.450
you were hugging him naked and all...

03:49.370 --> 03:51.800
I am... Yukito's...

03:52.820 --> 03:53.540
God.

03:53.540 --> 03:55.980
Again, what does that word mean?

03:55.980 --> 03:59.130
What is a God for Yukito-san?

04:01.760 --> 04:02.800
It's for life.

04:02.800 --> 04:04.680
We're together until death.

04:04.680 --> 04:06.140
That's what it means.

04:06.140 --> 04:06.840
What?

04:10.410 --> 04:13.930
You... you mean you promised 
to be with each other?

04:13.930 --> 04:17.480
So, what? He's not only married,

04:17.480 --> 04:20.280
but he's also into little girls?

04:20.280 --> 04:21.000
Wait, he likes little girls...

04:20.280 --> 04:23.320
Mumble mumble
 So, what? Not only is he married,
 but he's also into little girls?
 Wait, he likes little girls...
 Likes little girls?
 In what way?!
 Mumble mumble

04:21.000 --> 04:22.000
Likes little girls?

04:22.000 --> 04:23.320
In what way?!

04:23.320 --> 04:24.490
Oh, like,

04:23.320 --> 04:25.730
And you're done.

04:24.490 --> 04:26.780
he likes little girls and wants to be 
there and protect them for all his life!?

04:26.780 --> 04:30.940
Is there someone in this village who 
could turn me into a little girl?

04:27.090 --> 04:30.150
She's in love with Yukito, you see.

04:30.940 --> 04:32.400
Oneechan!

04:32.790 --> 04:33.910
I see.

04:34.460 --> 04:35.830
But listen,

04:35.830 --> 04:37.610
Yukito-san likes little girls,

04:37.610 --> 04:38.310
so I'm way too—

04:37.610 --> 04:38.310
It looks like...

04:38.310 --> 04:38.860
Huh?

04:39.250 --> 04:42.380
...people like Yukito here.

04:42.380 --> 04:43.840
I'm glad.

04:43.840 --> 04:44.800
Huh?

04:47.890 --> 04:51.420
It makes me happy that people like Yukito.

04:51.420 --> 04:54.880
So please continue to be 
friends with that child.

04:56.560 --> 04:57.590
Of course!

04:57.590 --> 04:59.850
<i>Um, is she his mother?</i>

05:01.030 --> 05:02.530
Hey, Clen.

05:02.890 --> 05:05.150
There're too many things I just don't know.

05:05.150 --> 05:07.430
Could you teach me more about this country?

05:07.430 --> 05:09.800
What exactly is this 'end of life'?

05:09.800 --> 05:12.540
Why on earth would there be a 
compulsory end to a person's life?

05:13.330 --> 05:18.790
The end of life system was established hundreds 
of years ago by the emperor and the parliament.

05:18.790 --> 05:21.070
Hundreds of years ago?

05:21.070 --> 05:24.130
Yu-ki-to!

05:24.130 --> 05:25.260
Mitama-chan.

05:25.260 --> 05:27.300
It's dangerous to jump onto him like that.

05:27.300 --> 05:28.110
Yukito!

05:27.300 --> 05:29.600
Yukito, who is that child?!

05:28.110 --> 05:29.600
Yukito, Yukito!

05:30.410 --> 05:34.940
Um, she came from the same country as I did.

05:34.940 --> 05:36.730
We've known each other for a long time.

05:44.280 --> 05:45.240
Beautiful!

05:45.860 --> 05:47.530
Please be my bride.

05:48.200 --> 05:48.990
Let go of me.

05:48.990 --> 05:50.490
Don't touch me, you filth.

05:51.770 --> 05:52.610
Roy!?

05:54.350 --> 05:56.810
I got shot down so hard...

05:57.550 --> 05:58.660
Something...

06:01.380 --> 06:04.710
So-so-soso-sososososo

06:05.880 --> 06:09.340
Something's about to be awakened in me!

06:11.290 --> 06:12.250
I...

06:12.250 --> 06:15.430
never thought he was this 
disgustingly creepy until today.

06:28.260 --> 06:29.590
Mitama-sama?

06:29.590 --> 06:30.410
Yes?

06:30.410 --> 06:36.700
So, what kind of miracles are 
your godly powers capable of?

06:36.700 --> 06:38.580
I can do absolutely anything.

06:38.580 --> 06:41.750
That's how great of a god I am.

06:41.750 --> 06:45.250
Could you win against an 
entire country's army?

06:45.250 --> 06:47.370
I'd just wash them away 
in a big gush of water,

06:47.370 --> 06:48.880
like whoosh!

06:48.880 --> 06:50.260
<i>I knew it.</i>

06:50.670 --> 06:53.610
<i>The sect I was in was a monotheistic sect.</i>

06:53.610 --> 06:57.080
<i>Monotheistic deities 
are usually omnipotent.</i>

06:57.080 --> 07:00.610
<i>I was thinking that being reborn into an 
alternate world without a cheat code was weird,</i>

07:00.610 --> 07:01.920
<i>but it's finally here,</i>

07:01.920 --> 07:04.590
<i>the ultimate legendary cheat 
code called "omnipotent god"!</i>

07:04.590 --> 07:08.570
Yes, so why I don't show 
you that whoosh right now?

07:08.570 --> 07:09.460
Hehe!

07:10.300 --> 07:10.890
Huh?

07:10.890 --> 07:11.320
Wait!

07:11.320 --> 07:13.230
Don't do it now!

07:23.700 --> 07:25.400
What are you doing?

07:25.880 --> 07:27.030
I'm going to kill you, Roy.

07:27.030 --> 07:28.550
Clean this up right now!

07:28.550 --> 07:29.380
Will do.

07:31.010 --> 07:34.720
Uh, that wasn't it, was it?

07:35.510 --> 07:39.100
<b>Followers</b>

07:35.980 --> 07:37.230
This can't be...

07:39.100 --> 07:39.800
I don't believe it.

07:39.800 --> 07:41.720
How can I have so few followers?

07:42.560 --> 07:48.230
<b>God</b>

07:42.680 --> 07:44.420
The more followers a god has,

07:44.420 --> 07:47.130
the more powerful they become.

07:47.130 --> 07:50.320
But you can't do anything if 
you've got zero followers.

07:51.360 --> 07:52.810
We're in an alternate world!

07:52.810 --> 07:55.200
Why did you think you'd 
have any followers here?!

07:55.510 --> 07:56.910
Why are you talking like that suddenly?

07:56.910 --> 07:59.320
Besides, how come it's zero? What about you?

07:59.320 --> 08:00.310
I can't believe this!

08:00.310 --> 08:04.120
I used the last of my 
powers to save your life!

08:02.720 --> 08:03.740
This is bad!

08:03.740 --> 08:05.230
The people from the Imperial capital

08:05.230 --> 08:06.710
have started to investigate that incident!

08:07.090 --> 08:09.660
Doesn't that mean that soldiers 
are going to show up here, too?

08:09.660 --> 08:10.900
That would be bad.

08:10.900 --> 08:12.500
Maybe we shouldn't be drinking.

08:12.500 --> 08:13.440
No worries!

08:13.440 --> 08:15.720
Yukito will sort it out again somehow!

08:15.720 --> 08:16.460
Right?

08:16.460 --> 08:19.350
Yeah, of course.

08:19.350 --> 08:21.130
Told you so!

08:19.870 --> 08:22.120
I knew he'd come through.

08:22.120 --> 08:24.830
We got this, no problem!

08:22.120 --> 08:25.690
The Imperial Army can bring it on!

08:26.800 --> 08:29.220
This'll be a piece of cake! Woo!

08:31.750 --> 08:32.660
<i>This is bad.</i>

08:33.570 --> 08:35.680
<i>This is really bad.</i>

08:37.410 --> 08:39.490
<i>Now what do I do?!</i>

08:39.490 --> 08:41.410
<i>At this rate...</i>

08:43.230 --> 08:45.730
It's mean to just leave me there.

08:51.480 --> 08:53.510
How dare you do that to a god...?

08:53.510 --> 08:54.250
I'm sorry.

08:54.250 --> 08:55.840
It was a reflex... No, screw that!

08:55.840 --> 08:57.090
Stop following me everywhere!

08:57.530 --> 08:59.820
But you were acting weird.

08:59.820 --> 09:00.960
What's wrong?

09:01.960 --> 09:03.650
There's nothing I can do.

09:04.330 --> 09:05.730
Because of me,

09:05.730 --> 09:09.440
this village might be attacked and destroyed.

09:09.440 --> 09:10.560
Really?

09:11.510 --> 09:14.530
Then the two of us should run away right now!

09:14.530 --> 09:16.240
I'm not going to do that!

09:18.910 --> 09:21.840
I can't just do nothing and run away again.

09:22.630 --> 09:23.740
That's...

09:26.080 --> 09:28.260
What's so wrong about running away?

09:28.260 --> 09:30.710
I've watched you from the beginning.

09:30.710 --> 09:32.170
You always gave your best,

09:32.470 --> 09:34.300
always kept enduring...

09:34.600 --> 09:37.430
So you're just going to do that again?

09:37.430 --> 09:38.090
No.

09:38.900 --> 09:41.490
I just let things happen to me.

09:41.490 --> 09:43.990
By the sect... by my dad...

09:43.990 --> 09:46.180
I kept running away from 
putting up resistance.

09:47.640 --> 09:50.180
And we saw how that turned out for me.

09:50.180 --> 09:51.060
Damn it!

09:53.690 --> 09:54.740
Mitama.

09:54.740 --> 09:57.020
If you get some followers,

09:57.020 --> 10:00.570
you'll be able to use your godly powers, right?

10:00.570 --> 10:03.080
I mean, yeah.

10:03.080 --> 10:06.160
Then I will make you a god.

10:06.160 --> 10:06.910
Huh?

10:06.910 --> 10:11.010
I am going to create "religion" 
and "God" in this world.

10:12.840 --> 10:18.350
I won't just stand by and do nothing 
like in the previous world.

10:21.110 --> 10:25.490
You'll do anything I say, right?

10:26.140 --> 10:28.820
Of... of course!

10:28.820 --> 10:32.730
I am your "follower"!

10:33.120 --> 10:37.030
I will lick anywhere you ask, with pleasure!

10:37.990 --> 10:39.610
Good boy.

10:39.610 --> 10:44.760
Such a wonderful servant deserves a reward.

11:00.630 --> 11:02.900
Roy, are you listening?

11:08.810 --> 11:11.020
Yeah. I'll become a follower.

11:11.470 --> 11:12.650
Good.

11:12.650 --> 11:16.240
<b>Followers</b>

11:13.820 --> 11:15.730
Yay, we got one!

11:15.730 --> 11:18.010
Wait, how come you're not a follower?!

11:18.010 --> 11:20.320
Hey, Yukito! You listening?!

11:20.320 --> 11:21.510
Hey, Yukito!

11:21.510 --> 11:23.600
Why?! Why?!

11:22.160 --> 11:23.600
Because you're like this!

11:23.600 --> 11:25.330
Stop, get off!

11:23.600 --> 11:26.040
Yukito!

11:28.200 --> 11:30.060
What's up, Chilchil?

11:31.950 --> 11:33.420
There, there.

11:33.940 --> 11:34.960
So starting today,

11:34.960 --> 11:42.510
m 0 0 l 254 0 l 254 60 l 0 60

11:34.960 --> 11:42.510
<b>Religious Organization "Salvation Through Mitama"
Ultimate Operating Leader and Ultimate Administrator of Will Interpretation
Urabe Yukito</b>

11:35.460 --> 11:38.620
we are going to spread a religion 
that worships Mitama as its god.

11:38.620 --> 11:42.510
If possible, I'd like to get us 10,000 
followers before the army comes and attacks.

11:42.510 --> 11:44.110
With that many followers,

11:42.510 --> 11:46.930
m 0 0 l 254 0 l 254 60 l 0 60

11:42.510 --> 11:46.930
<b>Only God of the Religious Organization "Salvation Through Mitama"
The Great Mitama, Exalted Goddess of the Eternal Land
(Shortened: Mitama)</b>

11:44.110 --> 11:47.280
I could reduce cities to ashes 
or even split oceans in two.

11:46.930 --> 11:50.890
m 0 0 l 254 0 l 254 60 l 0 60

11:46.930 --> 11:50.890
<b>Religious Organization "Salvation Through Mitama"
Chairman of Wide-Range Proselytization and Evangelism Department
Roy</b>

11:47.280 --> 11:50.890
I want to spread Mitama-sama's 
cuteness and her toe holy water!

11:50.890 --> 11:55.900
Performing actual miracles is the most 
effective way to amass followers...

11:56.610 --> 11:59.070
But right now, she's a 
shell of her former glory.

12:00.460 --> 12:02.870
We'll start off with a speech.

12:02.870 --> 12:07.910
My shitty dad taught me how to 
write speeches that excite followers,

12:07.910 --> 12:09.080
so I'll put together a draft, and...

12:09.080 --> 12:10.530
That won't be necessary.

12:11.000 --> 12:13.280
Even without the power to perform miracles,

12:13.280 --> 12:17.560
I've got godly wisdom that I gained by 
having lived over ten billion years.

12:17.560 --> 12:20.300
I'll use it to impress the extent 
of my powers upon the humans.

12:20.300 --> 12:23.680
Then they'll have no choice 
but to kneel before me!

12:23.680 --> 12:25.050
Pray to me!

12:25.050 --> 12:28.570
I've been alive ever since 
the universe was created,

12:28.570 --> 12:30.010
so pray to me!

12:30.010 --> 12:31.900
I know absolutely everything!

12:31.900 --> 12:34.770
If you want to know what I know,

12:34.770 --> 12:36.390
pray to me!

12:36.390 --> 12:38.610
Take Yukito over here!

12:38.610 --> 12:41.400
I know that the very first 
word he uttered wasn't "Mom",

12:41.400 --> 12:43.760
but "Mitama-sama".

12:43.760 --> 12:45.070
Goo-goo ga-ga!

12:45.070 --> 12:48.620
Or that he used to call broccoli "buccoroli".

12:49.060 --> 12:50.510
Buccoroli.

12:50.510 --> 12:54.120
Or that the birthmark on his right 
butt cheek isn't a birthmark,

12:54.120 --> 12:57.790
but a piece of embedded pencil lead!

12:59.450 --> 13:01.340
You were so cute.

13:01.340 --> 13:04.150
Let's see, what else do I know about Yukito?

13:05.380 --> 13:07.120
Enough speeches.

13:07.120 --> 13:10.390
I was wrong. Gods really 
have to perform miracles.

13:11.130 --> 13:14.810
B-But I don't have my powers yet.

13:15.230 --> 13:16.700
I know that.

13:16.700 --> 13:18.650
I'm not counting on you anymore.

13:18.650 --> 13:20.730
I'll have to do this all myself.

13:20.730 --> 13:23.430
Mitama-sama has done no wrong!
I think this dopey act is adorable.

13:23.430 --> 13:23.990
Dopey?!

13:28.570 --> 13:32.540
U-Um, so what are you doing?

13:37.860 --> 13:41.920
This Mitama-sama is a "god"!

13:41.920 --> 13:44.180
A god can perform a number of miracles.

13:44.180 --> 13:45.670
Reviving the dead,

13:45.670 --> 13:47.080
scattering countless armies,

13:47.080 --> 13:50.090
knowing all about past, present, and future.

13:50.090 --> 13:52.930
A being that transcends 
all human imagination.

13:53.460 --> 13:54.470
Oh...

13:54.470 --> 13:56.600
But merely being told so 
is not very convincing.

13:56.600 --> 14:00.960
That's why we shall show you 
one of Mitama-sama's miracles.

14:01.780 --> 14:02.460
Ahh!

14:02.460 --> 14:03.690
Alural!

14:02.460 --> 14:03.690
Eeeek!

14:04.780 --> 14:08.780
You currently have some relationship 
troubles, do you not?

14:10.260 --> 14:13.450
Yes... That's true.

14:14.440 --> 14:16.710
How do you know that?

14:16.710 --> 14:20.210
<i>Is it possible that he's noticed how I feel?</i>

14:20.790 --> 14:25.110
Mitama-sama used her godly 
powers to peek into your heart,

14:25.110 --> 14:27.530
and then she told me.

14:29.310 --> 14:30.640
Mitama-chan did this?

14:30.640 --> 14:34.060
<i>Yeah, right.</i>

14:34.060 --> 14:36.430
<i>This is basically just the Barnum effect.</i>

14:36.430 --> 14:40.550
<i>When a quack fortune-teller says something 
vague enough to apply to anybody,</i>

14:40.550 --> 14:44.260
<i>the one having their fortune told starts 
believing that it's all true.</i>

14:44.260 --> 14:46.220
<i>A very convenient psychological trick.</i>

14:46.220 --> 14:48.290
<i>I can use this to get people 
to start believing in Mitama...</i>

14:48.290 --> 14:50.710
Am I not amazing?

14:50.710 --> 14:53.490
Reading your minds is totally trivial.

14:55.990 --> 14:57.440
Alural...

14:57.440 --> 14:59.720
You've been agonizing about...

15:02.600 --> 15:03.210
I know!

15:03.210 --> 15:04.960
The weight you've gained!

15:04.960 --> 15:05.550
Wha?!

15:05.550 --> 15:08.410
It's because your breasts 
have gotten too big!

15:08.410 --> 15:09.340
No, it's not—

15:09.340 --> 15:11.440
By the way, Yukito prefers them small.

15:11.440 --> 15:12.620
Prefers them small.

15:12.700 --> 15:13.770
Prefers them small.

15:12.700 --> 15:16.760
S-Small...

15:13.850 --> 15:15.190
Prefers them small.

15:15.250 --> 15:16.770
Prefers them small.

15:20.570 --> 15:23.210
Someone lend me an ax.

15:23.210 --> 15:24.440
Stop it, Alural!

15:24.440 --> 15:25.770
I prefer big ones!

15:25.770 --> 15:28.220
I shall remove this useless meat right now!

15:28.220 --> 15:30.540
After all, you prefer small ones!

15:30.540 --> 15:32.570
Don't take everything 
Mitama says seriously!

15:32.570 --> 15:33.990
I like big ones!

15:34.990 --> 15:38.610
But since she's able to 
look into your heart,

15:38.610 --> 15:41.180
she surely knows what you truly like.

15:41.180 --> 15:44.270
That's... a different story.

15:44.270 --> 15:45.710
Damn it!

15:45.710 --> 15:50.960
Our god is so stupid that I don't 
know how to gather more followers!

15:50.960 --> 15:56.300
I really don't get why these 
villagers don't get my greatness.

15:59.500 --> 16:02.390
But I can't give up just yet.

16:02.390 --> 16:05.730
A person protected by the power of 
our god cannot be harmed by a sword!

16:06.940 --> 16:11.130
Let's see you take to the skies 
with the power of our god!

16:18.370 --> 16:19.580
Mitama! Hey!

16:19.580 --> 16:20.870
Mitama! Hey!

16:20.870 --> 16:22.000
Mitama!

16:23.800 --> 16:26.460
I'm a crap god.

16:26.460 --> 16:27.630
An impotent god.

16:27.630 --> 16:29.850
It's hopeless. Totally hopeless.

16:29.850 --> 16:32.290
Nobody is coming. Nobody's here.

16:33.360 --> 16:36.220
<i>Creating a religion sure is hard.</i>

16:35.300 --> 16:43.520
<b>Religion</b>

16:36.220 --> 16:39.440
<i>My shitty dad really was something.</i>

16:39.440 --> 16:42.620
<i>I shouldn't have been so quick 
to write him off as a sham.</i>

16:44.170 --> 16:45.520
Oneechan, there's trouble!

16:46.520 --> 16:48.480
<i>Don't tell me the Imperial 
army is already here?</i>

16:49.070 --> 16:50.570
It's Chilchil!

16:51.110 --> 16:54.950
It looks like she ate some anti-pest poison.

16:55.810 --> 16:57.850
This is bad.

16:57.850 --> 17:00.650
We need medicine—wait, no.
Take her to a vet first.

17:02.700 --> 17:08.510
The Imperial capital and the parliament 
won't do anything for non-human lives.

17:08.510 --> 17:12.860
We have neither the medicine 
nor the knowledge to treat her.

17:12.860 --> 17:14.730
There is nothing we can do.

17:15.800 --> 17:17.470
Chilchil...

17:19.460 --> 17:22.190
I'm sorry for making such a fuss.

17:22.190 --> 17:25.940
But this little one is like family to us.

17:39.200 --> 17:40.830
Yukito...?

17:42.410 --> 17:46.270
I made Mitama help me find some herbs 
which might act as an antidote.

17:46.270 --> 17:48.370
Let's use these to make some medicine!

17:48.990 --> 17:49.670
Huh?

17:53.020 --> 17:54.530
Here, drink.

17:54.530 --> 17:55.630
Hang in there...

18:00.600 --> 18:02.850
Good, let's see how this goes.

18:09.750 --> 18:11.400
It's weird.

18:11.400 --> 18:14.880
I don't think the old you 
would have done this.

18:14.880 --> 18:16.700
I guess you're right.

18:16.700 --> 18:19.280
But if there's something I can do,

18:19.280 --> 18:20.300
I want to do it.

18:23.780 --> 18:24.540
Damn it!

18:33.290 --> 18:35.880
No. Don't die.

18:36.670 --> 18:37.510
No!

18:38.600 --> 18:40.970
Chilchil!

18:44.320 --> 18:45.140
Mitama?

19:06.090 --> 19:07.780
Chilchil!

19:07.780 --> 19:10.900
I think she should be fine now.

19:13.710 --> 19:15.090
Mitama?

19:17.380 --> 19:21.980
I did it because you were in trouble.

19:22.600 --> 19:26.090
This is the power of that 
single perverted follower.

19:26.090 --> 19:28.890
That's the most I can 
manage right now, though.

19:29.220 --> 19:30.900
Thank you so much,

19:30.900 --> 19:33.190
Yukito-san and Mitama-chan!

19:39.780 --> 19:41.980
Oh, I got more followers.

19:41.980 --> 19:44.780
And I feel like I can use 
quite a bit of power now.

19:45.280 --> 19:48.890
You get that much more power 
from just three followers?

19:48.890 --> 19:51.150
This isn't normal.

19:51.150 --> 19:55.420
These two must have some 
kind of special ability.

19:57.500 --> 20:00.490
<i>Could it mean that the way 
someone becomes a follower</i>

20:00.490 --> 20:02.300
<i>affects the amount of power she can use?</i>

20:02.850 --> 20:08.450
<i>Alural and Siluril became followers after 
seeing Mitama's godly powers first-hand.</i>

20:08.450 --> 20:09.700
<i>On the other hand,</i>

20:09.700 --> 20:14.320
<i>Roy has a strong infatuation with 
Mitama and went the worship route.</i>

20:19.760 --> 20:22.650
I'm no longer a crap god or an impotent god!

20:22.650 --> 20:25.620
All you fools who showed me no reverence,

20:25.620 --> 20:26.930
just you watch!

20:26.930 --> 20:28.740
To start with!

20:28.740 --> 20:32.000
I'll prove what my powers can do!

20:32.930 --> 20:35.110
Wait! You're rushing ahead 
again without thinking!

20:35.110 --> 20:36.080
Um...

20:36.770 --> 20:39.550
If it's all right, I have a favor to ask.

20:40.320 --> 20:41.670
Okay, here I go.

20:42.030 --> 20:43.030
Sure!

20:43.030 --> 20:44.160
Are you serious?

20:44.830 --> 20:47.260
You're talking about bringing those 
guys from the empire back to life.

20:47.260 --> 20:50.270
They tried to kill us, you know?

20:50.270 --> 20:52.680
Why would you do that?

20:53.680 --> 20:58.530
I don't believe they were doing 
that job because they wanted to.

20:58.530 --> 21:00.680
They were only assigned those posts.

21:00.680 --> 21:02.070
I think it's fine.

21:02.670 --> 21:05.110
Maybe we'll get more drinking buddies,

21:05.110 --> 21:07.530
and Mitama-chan will protect us.

21:07.530 --> 21:09.690
<i>We're planning on going 
against the Imperial Army,</i>

21:09.690 --> 21:11.340
<i>so why on earth would we 
want to create more enemies?</i>

21:11.340 --> 21:14.400
<i>That Bertrand guy, especially, 
was too dangerous.</i>

21:14.400 --> 21:16.330
<i>We might actually get killed this time.</i>

21:20.040 --> 21:23.980
Come... back!

21:31.270 --> 21:33.140
All done.

21:35.170 --> 21:39.280
T-To think that I...

21:39.280 --> 21:41.420
would fear a mere child!

21:44.060 --> 21:44.900
Who are you?

21:44.900 --> 21:47.930
I am Bertrand, an Imperial Knight!

21:47.930 --> 21:49.100
Come again?

21:49.100 --> 21:51.600
Looks like I changed something?

21:51.600 --> 21:53.470
But it's better than before.

21:54.500 --> 21:57.340
Just kill me!

21:57.340 --> 21:59.670
Wow, you really just said that.

